Do you realize that if the transceiver works while connected to BM, that means it's working ?<br>Looks much more to be a network/configuration issue (I guess you're using a hotspot, since you gave the DMR+ settings), so <strong class="text-strong"><span style="font-size:200%;line-height:116%">YOU</span></strong> have to check your PiStar/Codeplug.<br><br><br>The codec is there, as YOU merge it to the firmware (you know, that donor file, etc, that's it), and if it was not there, you can't even enable DMR mode on the transceiver.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sat Dec 23, 2023 2:51 pm</p><hr />
